\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Construction and comparison of exploratory Minnesota forest layers. (A) Distinct FIA measurement years per physical plot during 2000--2025, shown at the latest public location. (B) Local ordinary-kriging estimates of basal-area density for the 2021--2025 measurement window, masked to ESA forest. (C) The exact ESA 2022 forest footprint used for the 2025 composite. (D) Percentage basal-area density change from the 2001--2005 to the 2021--2025 composites on shared forest pixels with positive baseline density. These statewide surfaces are not restricted to family ownership and are not design-based FIA estimates.}}{6}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:forest-layer-construction}{{1}{6}{Construction and comparison of exploratory Minnesota forest layers. (A) Distinct FIA measurement years per physical plot during 2000--2025, shown at the latest public location. (B) Local ordinary-kriging estimates of basal-area density for the 2021--2025 measurement window, masked to ESA forest. (C) The exact ESA 2022 forest footprint used for the 2025 composite. (D) Percentage basal-area density change from the 2001--2005 to the 2021--2025 composites on shared forest pixels with positive baseline density. These statewide surfaces are not restricted to family ownership and are not design-based FIA estimates}{figure.1}{}}
