\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Exploratory annualized live-carbon change valuation. (A) Signed 2025 annualized value density, using matched FIA visits and the ESA 2022 forest mask. (B) Absolute difference in annualized value density between the 2010 and 2025 endpoint composites on shared forest pixels. Blue indicates positive valued rates or increases; red indicates negative rates or decreases. Gray cells are outside the eligible mapped support. These are live-pool change proxies, not complete atmospheric sequestration estimates.}}{20}{figure.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:carbon-sequestration-maps}{{7}{20}{Exploratory annualized live-carbon change valuation. (A) Signed 2025 annualized value density, using matched FIA visits and the ESA 2022 forest mask. (B) Absolute difference in annualized value density between the 2010 and 2025 endpoint composites on shared forest pixels. Blue indicates positive valued rates or increases; red indicates negative rates or decreases. Gray cells are outside the eligible mapped support. These are live-pool change proxies, not complete atmospheric sequestration estimates}{figure.7}{}}
