\newlabel{fig:carbon-sequestration-series}{{8}{21}{Annualized live aboveground carbon change and its SCC-valued proxy for supported matched-FIA endpoint composites. The lower panel compares endpoint SCC prices with a fixed \$21.40/tCO$_2$ valuation, in 2007 USD/year. Quantity totals retain negative live-pool changes. The 2005 estimate is unavailable, and these interpolated rates should not be interpreted as a complete annual greenhouse-gas balance or family-forest GEP}{figure.8}{}}
