\newlabel{fig:biodiversity-maps}{{11}{26}{Exploratory nongame habitat-quality GEP proxy. (A) Extrapolated 2025 annual level value density on the ESA 2022 forest mask. (B) Absolute difference in the proxy between 2005 and 2025 on shared forest pixels; blue indicates increases and red decreases. Gray cells are outside the eligible mapped support. Surfaces are smoothed model interpolations of roadside survey routes, not censuses of biodiversity}{figure.11}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {12}{\ignorespaces BBS route-year landbird diversity near Minnesota and the statewide extrapolated habitat-quality level proxy. The upper panel shows route-year effective species, the model's statewide forest mean, and the 1966--1970 baseline window. The lower panel compares target-year households with a fixed 2005-household valuation. The 2020 BBS field season was largely cancelled, so 2020 is a model interpolation. Connecting lines are descriptive rather than annual observations.}}{27}{figure.12}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:biodiversity-series}{{12}{27}{BBS route-year landbird diversity near Minnesota and the statewide extrapolated habitat-quality level proxy. The upper panel shows route-year effective species, the model's statewide forest mean, and the 1966--1970 baseline window. The lower panel compares target-year households with a fixed 2005-household valuation. The 2020 BBS field season was largely cancelled, so 2020 is a model interpolation. Connecting lines are descriptive rather than annual observations}{figure.12}{}}
